  "family": {
    "id": "popcount-baselines",
    "issue": "26465e6c",
    "purpose": "kernel-family",
    "description": "Confirmatory family comparing gf2's production population-count dispatcher (crates/gf2-core/src/kernels/ops.rs popcount()) against libpopcnt, the Mula AVX2 Harley-Seal reference, and three labelled internal controls: the AVX2 nibble-LUT kernel called directly, a forced scalar POPCNT-instruction loop, and the portable compiler-optimized count_ones loop. gf2's dispatcher is the baseline in every cell; each cell asks whether one alternative reaches a material throughput gap against it. Cells cover small inputs, the dispatcher's scalar/vector selection boundary observed at 8 words in the emitted cmp $0x7, buffer alignment 24 bytes off a vector boundary, all-ones and all-zero bit patterns, the Mula carry-save network's 512-byte engagement threshold bracketed at 63 and 64 words, a cache-resident size and a streaming size. See dev/active/26465e6c/survey/objdump-evidence.txt for the observed thresholds."
  },
  "frozen": {
    "frozen_utc": "2026-09-08T09:37:42Z"
  },
  "effect": {
    "worthwhile_speedup": null,
    "rationale": "Unused: every cell in this family has objective comparator-gap, which decides against the material-gap threshold, not against a worthwhile speedup.",
    "measurement_resolution": 0.05,
    "resolution_evidence": {
      "receipt": "dev/bench_results/26465e6c/2026-09-08-26465e6c-popcount-pilot/receipt.json",
      "sha256": "f28291bd365cd9ee4104c45e8692a13e1436c78bfafcfc4509d149190c3c718d"
    },
    "equivalence_margin": 1.06,
    "equivalence_rationale": "An arm within a factor 1.06 of gf2's own implementation is not a materially different implementation for any consumer of these leaf kernels, so a cell whose interval lower bound stays above 1/1.06 is reported as not materially different rather than as a gap. The intended margin is 1.05, chosen on consumer benefit. The declared 1.05 lies inside the pilot-measured resolution 0.05, so it is widened to 1.06, the next whole percent outside that resolution; the operative margin is 1.06.",
    "material_gap_threshold": 1.1,
    "material_gap_rationale": "A comparator arm has to run at least 10% faster than gf2's own implementation before replacing that implementation, or moving its dispatch threshold, could repay the maintenance and dependency cost; below that the survey's conclusion is that gf2's existing kernel is retained. The threshold is tied to consumer benefit, not to the noise floor. The pilot receipt dev/bench_results/26465e6c/2026-09-08-26465e6c-popcount-pilot/receipt.json observed a widest relative confidence-interval half-width of 0.0401 in cell popcount-pilot-streaming-vs-mula, which rounds up to a measurement resolution of 0.05. The declared threshold lies outside that resolution."
  },
